fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"gstreamer/gstinfo.html#GstLogContextBuilder","fragment":"\n\tGstLogContextBuilder\n\n\n\tGst.LogContextBuilder\n\n\n\tGst.LogContextBuilder\n\nA builder for creating a GstLogContext. This provides a flexible way to\nconfigure a log context with various options while maintaining immutability\nof the resulting context.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nA builder for creating a Gst.LogContext. This provides a flexible way to\nconfigure a log context with various options while maintaining immutability\nof the resulting context.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nA builder for creating a Gst.LogContext. This provides a flexible way to\nconfigure a log context with various options while maintaining immutability\nof the resulting context.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});